msgctxt "184"
msgid "(So this is Stacy's room... What a lady.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Ahaha!"
msgstr "Ahah!"

msgctxt "208"
msgid "(...Hm?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, but before you get down and dirty, there's something\r\n"
"I'd like to discuss with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "What the...? What are you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Allow me to introduce a special \"instructor's course,\" only\r\n"
"available to valued customers who've purchased all the\r\n"
"handbooks, such as yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Once you've registered for the instructor's course, you'll\r\n"
"be qualified for a 15％ profit margin on every handbook you\r\n"
"sell. Sounding good already? But wait, there's more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"You'll also receive 5％ of tuition fees from any and all\r\n"
"instructors that sign up for the program through you...\r\n"
"You'll be rolling in cash before you know it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"The instructor's course is totally a great deal, Kiryu-san.\r\n"
"Let's become English teachers together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Wait... Your Japanese isn't broken at all! You're fluent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Well, duh! And besides, if you sign up for the instructor's\r\n"
"course... I can instruct you on a more \"intimate\" level."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"If you register now, I'll mark off some of the additional\r\n"
"fees and bump it down to 250,000 yen. Not a bad deal, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"There's no way I'd pay that much. You're clearly running a\r\n"
"scam."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Oh, is that so. How unfortunate... You leave me no choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "All right, you guys! You're up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Ｒｉｇｈｔ　ａｗａｙ，　ｍａ'ａｍ．"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Ｅｎｄ　ｏｆ　ｔｈｅ　ｌｉｎｅ，　Ｋｉｒｙｕ！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "250,000 yen... I guess I could part with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"You've made the right choice. Now then... Here's your\r\n"
"Instructor's Handbook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>250,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>English Teacher's Textbook<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, instructor registration is at the end of next\r\n"
"month. Once you finish that, we can send the Promoter's\r\n"
"Handbook to your address so you can start making that money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Oh, and Promoter's Handbooks are 50,000 yen each. Let me\r\n"
"know when you want one, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cosa?"

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
